WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.850
Lash extensions or a lash lift: two ways to beautiful lashes, but they're more different than you think!

2
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:11.197
Let's compare the cost, how long they last and how they feel.

3
00:00:11.197 --> 00:00:16.722
Cost: a lash lift at Moja is 30 €, and it takes 60 minutes.

4
00:00:16.722 --> 00:00:23.118
A classic set of extensions is 39 €, takes 90 minutes, and needs regular refills.

5
00:00:23.118 --> 00:00:27.808
How long: a lash lift holds its curl for about six to eight weeks.

6
00:00:27.808 --> 00:00:33.686
Extensions shed slowly with your natural lashes, so you refill them every two to three weeks.

7
00:00:33.686 --> 00:00:39.577
Feel: with a lash lift, they're simply your own lashes, so it feels like nothing at all.

8
00:00:39.577 --> 00:00:44.528
Extensions make your lashes much fuller and longer, but they need more care.

9
00:00:44.528 --> 00:00:51.620
Natural and low-maintenance? Choose a lash lift. Clearly fuller, longer lashes? Choose extensions.

10
00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:55.908
Still can't decide? Ask Moja Beauty, and we'll help you choose!

11
00:00:55.908 --> 00:01:01.851
Book Moja Beauty in seconds on VaraaAi: pick a service, pick a time, done!
